orphism <MATH_0023>, and\n<STRUCT_0007> the diagram\n<MATH_0024>\nis commutative.\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009>\nThe functors <MATH_0025>\nand <MATH_0026> are the\nforgetful functors in this case. The transformation <MATH_0027> is given on the object <MATH_0028> by\n<MATH_0029>.\n<STRUCT_0010>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7891914cbc58fa48287dc991a25a8060895716462ef47fafa79e6db5c37c44af", "unit_id": "inventory:categories:0040:lemma/0001"}, "state": "READY"}, "reference:categories-lemma-2-product-fibred-categories": {"context_hash": "sha256:d3de38c43960179d1377bd1c0b65702fdee40a0cd424d34ae18f7d8110f3a4a7", "kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 255764, "byte_start": 255496, "file": "categories.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:589e1967e040dc9cbdc0a6731f5c856ca9bdd52591dc8a39a1cb1fc80fa3ff67", "line_end": 7234, "line_start": 7228}, "owner_tag": "0041", "parent_tag": "003S", "requested_label": "categories-lemma-2-product-fibred-categories", "requested_tag": "0041", "semantic_path": "lemma/0001", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "003S", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-2-product-fibred-categories}", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-2-product-categories-over-C}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a09c24ec2d25cd681716b94fac9200b9048bae113080f6001113641b30bad3cf", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ec16f171995b46e35ff5f2be3c92575c664c412cfc2112a4e82fe19453d75c37", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a category.\nThe <MATH_0002>-category of categories fibred in groupoids\nover <MATH_0003> has 2-fibre products, and 